/run/initialize
/analysis/eventSelection edep
/analysis/neutronHistoryTarget LiGlass
/analysis/opticalRecording off

/gps/particle neutron
/gps/number 1
/gps/pos/type Point
/gps/pos/centre 0 0 0 mm
/gps/ene/type Mono
/gps/ang/type iso

/run/printProgress 100000
/control/loop scan_neutron_step.mac EkeV 204 500 4